@ref Dieu 46 (src:918-932)
`a late notice under a contract with sanctions` MEANS `A notice of the insured event` WITH
    `the policyholder notified within the time the contract agrees` IS FALSE
    `force majeure or an objective obstacle prevented timely notice` IS FALSE
    `the contract agrees the policyholder's responsibility and the sanctions for failing or delaying to notify` IS TRUE
    `the loss the insurer bears because of the failure or delay` IS 15_000_000
    `compensation otherwise payable` IS 100_000_000
`a late notice under a contract without sanctions` MEANS `A notice of the insured event` WITH
    `the policyholder notified within the time the contract agrees` IS FALSE
    `force majeure or an objective obstacle prevented timely notice` IS FALSE
    `the contract agrees the policyholder's responsibility and the sanctions for failing or delaying to notify` IS FALSE
    `the loss the insurer bears because of the failure or delay` IS 15_000_000
    `compensation otherwise payable` IS 100_000_000
`a late notice excused by force majeure` MEANS `A notice of the insured event` WITH
    `the policyholder notified within the time the contract agrees` IS FALSE
    `force majeure or an objective obstacle prevented timely notice` IS TRUE
    `the contract agrees the policyholder's responsibility and the sanctions for failing or delaying to notify` IS TRUE
    `the loss the insurer bears because of the failure or delay` IS 15_000_000
    `compensation otherwise payable` IS 100_000_000
`a timely notice under a contract with sanctions` MEANS `A notice of the insured event` WITH
    `the policyholder notified within the time the contract agrees` IS TRUE
    `force majeure or an objective obstacle prevented timely notice` IS FALSE
    `the contract agrees the policyholder's responsibility and the sanctions for failing or delaying to notify` IS TRUE
    `the loss the insurer bears because of the failure or delay` IS 15_000_000
    `compensation otherwise payable` IS 100_000_000
`a late notice costing more than the compensation` MEANS `A notice of the insured event` WITH
    `the policyholder notified within the time the contract agrees` IS FALSE
    `force majeure or an objective obstacle prevented timely notice` IS FALSE
    `the contract agrees the policyholder's responsibility and the sanctions for failing or delaying to notify` IS TRUE
    `the loss the insurer bears because of the failure or delay` IS 150_000_000
    `compensation otherwise payable` IS 100_000_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 46: the insurer may reduce the compensation` `a late notice under a contract with sanctions`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 46: the insurer may reduce the compensation` `a late notice under a contract without sanctions`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 46: the insurer may reduce the compensation` `a late notice excused by force majeure`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 46: the insurer may reduce the compensation` `a timely notice under a contract with sanctions`
#ASSERT `Dieu 46: the compensation after the reduction` `a late notice under a contract with sanctions` EQUALS 85_000_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 46: the compensation after the reduction` `a late notice under a contract without sanctions` EQUALS 100_000_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 46: the compensation after the reduction` `a late notice excused by force majeure` EQUALS 100_000_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 46: the compensation after the reduction` `a late notice costing more than the compensation` EQUALS 0

§§ `Dieu 47`

