`the first of two contracts` MEANS `A contract in a double insurance` WITH
    `sum insured` IS 60_000_000
`the second of two contracts` MEANS `A contract in a double insurance` WITH
    `sum insured` IS 40_000_000
`two contracts above the value` MEANS `A double insurance` WITH
    `contracts` IS LIST `the first of two contracts`, `the second of two contracts`
    `market value of the property at the time of making` IS 80_000_000
    `actual loss` IS 50_000_000
    `the contracts cover the same scope, object, term and insured event` IS TRUE
`two contracts within the value` MEANS `A double insurance` WITH
    `contracts` IS LIST `the first of two contracts`, `the second of two contracts`
    `market value of the property at the time of making` IS 100_000_000
    `actual loss` IS 50_000_000
    `the contracts cover the same scope, object, term and insured event` IS TRUE
`two contracts with different cover` MEANS `A double insurance` WITH
    `contracts` IS LIST `the first of two contracts`, `the second of two contracts`
    `market value of the property at the time of making` IS 80_000_000
    `actual loss` IS 50_000_000
    `the contracts cover the same scope, object, term and insured event` IS FALSE
`one contract` MEANS `A double insurance` WITH
    `contracts` IS LIST `the first of two contracts`
    `market value of the property at the time of making` IS 10_000_000
    `actual loss` IS 5_000_000
    `the contracts cover the same scope, object, term and insured event` IS TRUE
#ASSERT `Dieu 49(1): the contracts are in double insurance` `two contracts above the value`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 49(1): the contracts are in double insurance` `two contracts within the value`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 49(1): the contracts are in double insurance` `two contracts with different cover`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 49(1): the contracts are in double insurance` `one contract`
#ASSERT `Dieu 49(2): the compensation under the contract` `two contracts above the value` `the first of two contracts` EQUALS 30_000_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 49(2): the compensation under the contract` `two contracts above the value` `the second of two contracts` EQUALS 20_000_000
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 49(2): the compensation under the contract` `two contracts within the value` `the first of two contracts`

