`repair agreed` MEANS `A form agreed for compensation` WITH
    `form agreed` IS JUST `repair of the damaged property`
    `the damaged property was replaced or fully compensated at market value` IS FALSE
`replacement agreed and done` MEANS `A form agreed for compensation` WITH
    `form agreed` IS JUST `replacement of the damaged property by other property`
    `the damaged property was replaced or fully compensated at market value` IS TRUE
`money paid in full` MEANS `A form agreed for compensation` WITH
    `form agreed` IS JUST `payment of compensation in money`
    `the damaged property was replaced or fully compensated at market value` IS TRUE
`no form agreed` MEANS `A form agreed for compensation` WITH
    `form agreed` IS NOTHING
    `the damaged property was replaced or fully compensated at market value` IS FALSE
`no form agreed, paid in full` MEANS `A form agreed for compensation` WITH
    `form agreed` IS NOTHING
    `the damaged property was replaced or fully compensated at market value` IS TRUE
`replacement agreed, not yet done` MEANS `A form agreed for compensation` WITH
    `form agreed` IS JUST `replacement of the damaged property by other property`
    `the damaged property was replaced or fully compensated at market value` IS FALSE
`repair agreed and paid` MEANS `A form agreed for compensation` WITH
    `form agreed` IS JUST `repair of the damaged property`
    `the damaged property was replaced or fully compensated at market value` IS TRUE
#ASSERT `Dieu 52: the form of compensation` `repair agreed` EQUALS `repair of the damaged property`
#ASSERT `Dieu 52: the form of compensation` `no form agreed` EQUALS `payment of compensation in money`
#ASSERT `Dieu 52(3): the insurer may recover the damaged property` `replacement agreed and done`
#ASSERT `Dieu 52(3): the insurer may recover the damaged property` `money paid in full`
#ASSERT `Dieu 52(3): the insurer may recover the damaged property` `no form agreed, paid in full`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 52(3): the insurer may recover the damaged property` `replacement agreed, not yet done`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 52(3): the insurer may recover the damaged property` `repair agreed and paid`

