@ref Dieu 53-55 (src:1012-1064)
`a dispute on the extent of the loss` MEANS `A loss adjustment and recourse` WITH
    `the parties agree on the cause and extent of the loss` IS FALSE
    `the parties agreed to hire an independent loss adjuster` IS FALSE
    `the contract provides otherwise` IS FALSE
    `a third person is liable for the loss` IS FALSE
    `the insured person refused to transfer the right to claim against the third person` IS FALSE
    `the third person is the insured person's parent, spouse or child` IS FALSE
    `that person deliberately caused the loss` IS FALSE
    `compensation paid` IS 0
`agreement on the extent of the loss` MEANS `A loss adjustment and recourse` WITH
    `the parties agree on the cause and extent of the loss` IS TRUE
    `the parties agreed to hire an independent loss adjuster` IS FALSE
    `the contract provides otherwise` IS FALSE
    `a third person is liable for the loss` IS FALSE
    `the insured person refused to transfer the right to claim against the third person` IS FALSE
    `the third person is the insured person's parent, spouse or child` IS FALSE
    `that person deliberately caused the loss` IS FALSE
    `compensation paid` IS 0
`a dispute with an adjuster agreed` MEANS `A loss adjustment and recourse` WITH
    `the parties agree on the cause and extent of the loss` IS FALSE
    `the parties agreed to hire an independent loss adjuster` IS TRUE
    `the contract provides otherwise` IS FALSE
    `a third person is liable for the loss` IS FALSE
    `the insured person refused to transfer the right to claim against the third person` IS FALSE
    `the third person is the insured person's parent, spouse or child` IS FALSE
    `that person deliberately caused the loss` IS FALSE
    `compensation paid` IS 0
`a dispute under a contract that provides otherwise` MEANS `A loss adjustment and recourse` WITH
    `the parties agree on the cause and extent of the loss` IS FALSE
    `the parties agreed to hire an independent loss adjuster` IS FALSE
    `the contract provides otherwise` IS TRUE
    `a third person is liable for the loss` IS FALSE
    `the insured person refused to transfer the right to claim against the third person` IS FALSE
    `the third person is the insured person's parent, spouse or child` IS FALSE
    `that person deliberately caused the loss` IS FALSE
    `compensation paid` IS 0
#ASSERT `Dieu 53(2): the parties may agree to hire an independent loss adjuster` `a dispute on the extent of the loss`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 53(2): the parties may agree to hire an independent loss adjuster` `agreement on the extent of the loss`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 53(2): the parties may agree to hire an independent loss adjuster` `a dispute under a contract that provides otherwise`
#ASSERT `Dieu 53(2): a party may ask the court or arbitration to obtain an independent loss adjuster` `a dispute on the extent of the loss`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 53(2): a party may ask the court or arbitration to obtain an independent loss adjuster` `a dispute with an adjuster agreed`
`a paid claim with a liable third person` MEANS `A loss adjustment and recourse` WITH
    `the parties agree on the cause and extent of the loss` IS FALSE
    `the parties agreed to hire an independent loss adjuster` IS FALSE
    `the contract provides otherwise` IS FALSE
    `a third person is liable for the loss` IS TRUE
    `the insured person refused to transfer the right to claim against the third person` IS FALSE
    `the third person is the insured person's parent, spouse or child` IS FALSE
    `that person deliberately caused the loss` IS FALSE
    `compensation paid` IS 10_000_000
`a paid claim, transfer refused` MEANS `A loss adjustment and recourse` WITH
    `the parties agree on the cause and extent of the loss` IS FALSE
    `the parties agreed to hire an independent loss adjuster` IS FALSE
    `the contract provides otherwise` IS FALSE
    `a third person is liable for the loss` IS TRUE
    `the insured person refused to transfer the right to claim against the third person` IS TRUE
    `the third person is the insured person's parent, spouse or child` IS FALSE
    `that person deliberately caused the loss` IS FALSE
    `compensation paid` IS 10_000_000
`a claim not yet paid` MEANS `A loss adjustment and recourse` WITH
    `the parties agree on the cause and extent of the loss` IS FALSE
    `the parties agreed to hire an independent loss adjuster` IS FALSE
    `the contract provides otherwise` IS FALSE
    `a third person is liable for the loss` IS TRUE
    `the insured person refused to transfer the right to claim against the third person` IS FALSE
    `the third person is the insured person's parent, spouse or child` IS FALSE
    `that person deliberately caused the loss` IS FALSE
    `compensation paid` IS 0
`a paid claim, the third person is a child` MEANS `A loss adjustment and recourse` WITH
    `the parties agree on the cause and extent of the loss` IS FALSE
    `the parties agreed to hire an independent loss adjuster` IS FALSE
    `the contract provides otherwise` IS FALSE
    `a third person is liable for the loss` IS TRUE
    `the insured person refused to transfer the right to claim against the third person` IS FALSE
    `the third person is the insured person's parent, spouse or child` IS TRUE
    `that person deliberately caused the loss` IS FALSE
    `compensation paid` IS 10_000_000
`a paid claim, the child caused it deliberately` MEANS `A loss adjustment and recourse` WITH
    `the parties agree on the cause and extent of the loss` IS FALSE
    `the parties agreed to hire an independent loss adjuster` IS FALSE
    `the contract provides otherwise` IS FALSE
    `a third person is liable for the loss` IS TRUE
    `the insured person refused to transfer the right to claim against the third person` IS FALSE
    `the third person is the insured person's parent, spouse or child` IS TRUE
    `that person deliberately caused the loss` IS TRUE
    `compensation paid` IS 10_000_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 54(1)(a): the insured person must transfer the right to claim reimbursement` `a paid claim with a liable third person`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 54(1)(a): the insured person must transfer the right to claim reimbursement` `a claim not yet paid`
#ASSERT `Dieu 54(1)(b): the insurer may deduct from the compensation` `a paid claim, transfer refused`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 54(1)(b): the insurer may deduct from the compensation` `a paid claim with a liable third person`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 54(1)(b): the amount the insurer may deduct` `a paid claim, transfer refused`
#ASSERT `Dieu 54(3): the insurer may claim reimbursement from the third person` `a paid claim with a liable third person`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 54(3): the insurer may claim reimbursement from the third person` `a paid claim, the third person is a child`
#ASSERT `Dieu 54(3): the insurer may claim reimbursement from the third person` `a paid claim, the child caused it deliberately`
`no safety measures, time not fixed` MEANS `A safety measure` WITH
    `the insured person failed to take the safety measures` IS TRUE
    `the insurer fixed a time for taking them` IS FALSE
    `the time has expired and they are still not taken` IS FALSE
`no safety measures, time fixed and running` MEANS `A safety measure` WITH
    `the insured person failed to take the safety measures` IS TRUE
    `the insurer fixed a time for taking them` IS TRUE
    `the time has expired and they are still not taken` IS FALSE
`no safety measures, time expired` MEANS `A safety measure` WITH
    `the insured person failed to take the safety measures` IS TRUE
    `the insurer fixed a time for taking them` IS TRUE
    `the time has expired and they are still not taken` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 55(3): the insurer may raise the premium or terminate the contract` `no safety measures, time not fixed`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 55(3): the insurer may raise the premium or terminate the contract` `no safety measures, time fixed and running`
#ASSERT `Dieu 55(3): the insurer may raise the premium or terminate the contract` `no safety measures, time expired`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 56: the insured person may abandon the insured property` FALSE
#ASSERT `Dieu 56: the insured person may abandon the insured property` TRUE

